# EcoSprint Supabase configuration (FREE tier)
# Copy this file to .env and fill in your Supabase project values.
#
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Go to Project Settings -> API
# 3. Copy the "Project URL" and the "anon" / "publishable" public key.
#    NEVER use the service_role (secret) key in this frontend app.
#
# VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://YOUR-PROJECT-REF.supabase.co
# VITE_SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=YOUR-ANON-PUBLIC-KEY